  "design": {
    "decision": "Play winners back to back every round (cash a suit before switching), because each pair also adds to the run-long total.",
    "opponent": "Revealed the first time it grows; opponents break runs by taking the lead whenever they can and by switching suits.",
    "rationale": "Run-long growth belongs at rare; the earlier growth seeds failed on rare conditions (17-28% fire), so this one grows on the most frequent Streaks trigger (about 90% of rounds, several times per round), like the kept cb-grow-make-mult.",
